            ("What is the purpose of a 'Workaround' in a security advisory?", ["Providing temporary mitigation instructions to reduce risk when immediate patching is not possible", "Explaining how to exploit the vulnerability", "Complaining about software quality", "Hiding the CVE from auditors"], "Providing temporary mitigation instructions to reduce risk when immediate patching is not possible", "Mesure d'atténuation temporaire en attendant le déploiement du patch.")
