            ("Complete: 'Endpoint Detection and Response (___) agents capture telemetry on process creation, file modifications, and network connections.'", ["EDR (e.g. CrowdStrike, Defender, SentinelOne)", "VPC", "DNS", "NAT"], "EDR (e.g. CrowdStrike, Defender, SentinelOne)", "EDR (Endpoint Detection and Response)."),
