            ("Choose the behavior indicating privilege escalation: 'Technique T1068 describes exploitation of software vulnerabilities to gain administrative ___.'", ["privileges", "bandwidth", "memory", "storage"], "privileges", "Élévation de privilèges (Privilege Escalation).")
