            ("Choose the cryptographically broken hashing algorithm prohibited in compliance standards: '___ must never be used for digital signatures due to collision vulnerabilities.'", ["SHA-1 / MD5", "SHA-256", "SHA-384", "SHA-512"], "SHA-1 / MD5", "MD5 et SHA-1 sont formellement interdits en raison des collisions."),
            ("Complete: 'Public Key Infrastructure (___) manages the issuance, distribution, and revocation of digital certificates.'", ["PKI", "API", "RAM", "CPU"], "PKI", "PKI (Public Key Infrastructure)."),
