            ("Complete: 'Mutual TLS (mTLS) enforces bidirectional cryptographic ___ between the client and the server.'", ["authentication", "deletion", "compression", "routing"], "authentication", "Authentification mutuelle bidirectionnelle en mTLS."),
            ("Choose the term for quantum-resistant cryptography: 'Organizations are beginning migrations toward Post-___ Cryptography (PQC) standards approved by NIST.'", ["Quantum", "Modern", "Future", "Classical"], "Quantum", "Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC)."),
