            ("Complete: 'The ransomware payload utilized double ___: encrypting operational data while threatening to leak stolen exfiltrated records.'", ["extortion", "encryption", "trouble", "deletion"], "extortion", "Double extortion (chiffrement des données et chantage à la divulgation)."),
            ("Choose the secure out-of-band communication channel during total enterprise compromise: 'All crisis communications were moved to an out-of-band ___ platform (e.g. Signal, dedicated clean tenant).'", ["encrypted", "unencrypted", "public", "broadcast"], "encrypted", "Canal de communication hors-bande chiffré (out-of-band)."),
